WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.020
Put two Bibles side by side:
one from a Catholic church,

2
00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.960
one from a Protestant church.

3
00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:07.380
They look alike.

4
00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:09.420
Now count the books inside.

5
00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:11.680
The Protestant Bible has 66.

6
00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:14.560
The Catholic Bible has 73.

7
00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:17.290
And Orthodox Bibles have more again.

8
00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:21.220
Why does a Catholic Bible have
more books than a Protestant one?

9
00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:24.700
In this mission, you'll open
the Bible section by section,

10
00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.700
from the Law to the Letters.

11
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:30.250
Then you'll trace how Christians
came to agree a list of books,

12
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.800
called the canon.

13
00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:36.310
Your mission: find out why Catholic and
Protestant Bibles have different numbers

14
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:37.150
of books.
